    "detailed_description": "Rather than confining Earth to a singular form, let's unleash its diversity by shaping it in various forms. <br />\r\nIn this interactive experience, you can pause Earth's constant flux and craft your rendition. The paused Earth becomes 'YOUR EARTH,' which you can explore from multiple viewpoints. Moreover, accompanied by ambient music, you can contemplate while witnessing Earth morph into various shapes. <br />\r\nThis game promises to alter your perception of our planet.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDistribution Guidelines:<br />\r\nInclude the name of the game in the title of the video or live stream. Also, include the URL of the store page in the summary or description section of the video or live stream.",
